{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-sage-of-mind-and-action","title":"知行合一的圣哲：三不朽之名","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-sage-of-mind-and-action","wordCount":1591,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判：贡献、争议与现代重估","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1634,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章对王阳明作出综合评价。&quot;知行合一的圣哲&quot;，是对王阳明崇高地位最贴切的尊称——他以集心学之大成（立言）、平定叛乱的赫赫事功（立功）、致良知此心光明的崇高德性（立德），成就了&quot;三不朽&quot;的伟业。而全面的评判，则要求我们既充分肯定其卓越贡献与崇高人格，又客观正视围绕其心学的种种探讨与争议，以辩证的眼光，认识这位不朽的圣哲。</p>\n"}